WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.305
A SPOKESPERSON FOR CHINA'S
FOREIGN MINISTRY DEFLECTING

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.173
REPORTERS QUESTIONS ON PROTEST

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:11.644
AND LOOKING TO SEE IF CHINA IS
LOOKING TO END THE STRICT COVID

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:15.615
POLICIES.
&gt;&gt; IVAN WATSON IS IN HONG KONG,

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:18.384
HONG KONG HAS ITS OWN HISTORY OF
PROTESTS AND ALSO OF CRACKDOWNS.

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:21.354
YOU'VE SEEN SOME PROTESTS THERE.
PEOPLE DEFYING THE POLICE AS

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:25.258
WELL IN SOLIDARITY.
HOW EXTENSIVE?

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:30.630
&gt;&gt; WELL TWO KIND OF SMALL
DEMONSTRATIONS OF PEOPLE NOT

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:34.901
MORE THAN A HUNDRED DEMONSTRATE
YE

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:38.505
ORS AT THE ONE I VISITED A FEW
HOURS AGO BUT ALL THE MORE RARE

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:43.243
BECAUSE HONG KONG HAS BANNED
TERRITORYING AND CRACKDOWN ON

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:47.180
INDEPENDENT MEDIA AND OPPOSITION
POLITICAL PARTIES AND THROWN

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:53.987
ACTIVIST NEWS PRISON.
AND IT GOES TO SHOW HOW THE VERY

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:56.990
UNUSUAL NATIONWIDE PROTESTS THAT
WE'VE SEEN IN CHINA HAVE THIS

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:03.263
POWER TO KIND OF INSPIRE PEOPLE
HERE IN THE FORMER BRITISH

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:06.633
COLONY AS WELL.
I THINK THIS IS PROBABLY THE

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:10.403
BIGGEST NATIONWIDE MANIFESTATION
OF PUBLIC DISCONTENT THAT WE'VE

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:15.508
SEEN IN CHINA IN A GENERATION.
I SPOKE TO ONE OF THE PEOPLE WHO

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:19.746
WAS OUT IN HONG KONG, A MAN WHO
ONLY WANTED TO GIVE HIS FIRST

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:25.318
NAME WHO IS FROM SHANGHAI, AND
HE DESCRIBED HIMSELF AS A VICTIM

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:29.522
OF CHINA'S ZERO COVID POLICY.
TAKE A LISTEN.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:33.159
&gt;&gt; I AM A VICTIM.
I CANNOT GO HOME.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.695
FOR MANY YEARS.
LIKE TWO TO THREE YEARS, RIGHT.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:39.465
MY PARENTS WERE LOCKED DOWN FOR
TH

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:43.469
THREE MONTHS.
AND EVEN RELATIVES OF MY GOOD

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:46.606
FRIENDS, THEY HAD SUICIDE
BECAUSE OF THE LOCKDOWNS.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:50.710
RIGHT.
AND I KNOW PEOPLE DIE BECAUSE OF

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.145
IT.
BECAUSE OF THE SIDE EFFECTS OF

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:57.016
THIS POLICY, RIGHT.
I THINK EVERYONE WHO HAS A SANE

00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:01.654
MINDP SHOULD SAY SOMETHING OR DO
SOMETHING TO STOP THIS

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:06.025
UNREASONABLE SOCIAL MEASURE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: NOW, WE HAVE BEEN

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:09.762
ABLE TO CONFIRM 16 SEPARATE
PROTESTS IN MAINLAND CHINA

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:13.700
ACROSS 11 DIFFERENT CITIES.
AND OF COURSE WE HAVE REPORTS OF

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:19.405
ADDITIONAL PROTESTS BUT IT IS SO
HARD TO MAKE SENSE OF THAT AND

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:22.475
CONFIRM IT AND VERIFY IT GIVEN
THE INTENSE CENSORSHIP ON THE

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:30.617
MAIN LAND.
&gt;&gt; JUST INCREDIBLE TO SEE THESE

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:36.422
PROTESTS IN SEVERAL CITIES.
&gt;&gt;&gt; JOINING ME NOW IS BRONNY

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:40.760
LYNN, WORKED AT PENTAGON ON
TAIWAN AND CHINA ISSUES.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.194
GOOD TO HAVE YOU ON THIS
MORNING.

00:02:42.194 --> 00:02:44.631
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU, JIM, THANK YOU,
BIANNA.

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:47.800
&gt;&gt; SO LET'S BEGIN, THESE ARE
UNUSUAL AND COURAGEOUS BECAUSE

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:51.271
OF THE PRICE THAT PEOPLE PAY FOR
DISSENT IN CHINA.

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:57.043
AND THEY'RE NATIONAL, LEAST IN
MANY LARGE CITIES, DO THEY POSE

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:59.879
A GENUINE THREAT TO THE CHINESE
GOVERNMENT?

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:06.052
&gt;&gt; I THINK RIGHT NOW IT IS A BIT
EARLY TO SAY THAT BECAUSE WE'RE

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:09.822
ON DAY TWO AND A HALF OR THREE.
IF YOU LOOK AT THE LARGE SCALE

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:13.959
PROTESTS THAT HAS HAD A
SIGNIFICANT IMPACT ON I THINK

00:03:13.959 --> 00:03:17.063
TIANANMEN IN 1989 IS THE BEST
EXAMPLE, IT STARTED IN APRIL AND

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:20.199
WE DIDN'T SEE THE CULMINATION OF
THE EFFECT UNTIL JUNE.

00:03:20.199 --> 00:03:25.972
SO WE STILL HAVE A LITTLE BIT OF
TIME TO SEE HOW MUCH THIS WILL

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:29.342
SPREAD AND WHAT WE'RE SEEING
RIGHT NOW IS AT LEAST 16

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:31.711
DIFFERENT LOCATIONS.
BUT WE STILL DON'T HAVE A SENSE

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:35.448
OF HOW LARGE THIS IS.
IT SEEMS LIKE EACH LOCATION IS A

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:38.284
COUPLE HUNDRED PEOPLE PER
LOCATION.

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:42.488
AND IF IT IS SPREAD OUT ACROSS
THE COUNTRY, IT IS ACTUALLY NOT

00:03:42.488 --> 00:03:46.826
TOO DIFFICULT FOR CHINA TO CLAMP
DOWN, IF IT IS ONLY A COUPLE

00:03:46.826 --> 00:03:49.629
HUNDRED PER LOCATION.
BUT IF WE SEE TENS OF THOUSANDS

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:54.067
IN ONE LOCATION, I THINK
PARTICULARLY AS IT GET CENTERED

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:57.103
AROUND BEIJING, THAT IS MUCH
MORE OF A CHALLENGE FOR THE

00:03:57.103 --> 00:03:59.472
CHINESE GOVERNMENT TO DEAL WITH.
&gt;&gt; BUT THE FACT THERE ARE

00:03:59.472 --> 00:04:04.977
ALREADY 16 PROTESTS TELLS YOU
THAT CHINA'S VERY POWERFUL

00:04:04.977 --> 00:04:09.248
CENSORSHIP MACHINE HAS NOT BEEN
ABLE TO ACT QUICKLY ENOUGH TO

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:13.552
TAKE DOWN SOME OF THE VIDEOS AND
POSTS DENOUNCING ZERO COVID

00:04:13.552 --> 00:04:17.390
POLICY, DENOUNCING XI JINPING
HIMSELF.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:19.092
WHAT DOES THAT TELL YOU ABOUT
THEIR LIMITATIONS BECAUSE THIS

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:23.596
IS THE FIRST TIME WE'VE SEEN
THEM CHALLENGED TO THIS EXTENT

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:28.334
UNDER XI JINPING?
&gt;&gt; THAT IS A GREAT QUESTION.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:33.373
I THINK WHAT WE NEED TO SEE TO
WHAT EXTENT THE MEASURES THE

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:36.642
CHINESE GOVERNMENT HAS TAKEN
INCLUDING MORE POLICING, MORE

00:04:36.642 --> 00:04:40.313
ARRESTS, MORE CENSORSHIP, TO
WHAT EXTENT THIS WILL CURB THE

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:44.250
PROTESTS MOVING FORWARD.
SO WHAT WE DON'T KNOW IS, FOR

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.587
EXAMPLE, TONIGHT, MONDAY NIGHT
OR TOMORROW, IF THIS WILL

00:04:47.587 --> 00:04:53.426
CONTINUE TO ESCALATOR IF CHINA
WILL HAVE BEEN ABLE TO SORT OF

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:59.365
TONE THIS DOWN A LITTLE BIT.
BUT I WOULD SAY EVEN IF WE SEE

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:00.833
MORE PROTESTS GROWING THE NEXT
COUPLE OF DAYS, WE DON'T SEE THE

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:03.603
SAME POLITICAL CONDITIONS THAT
WE SAW THERE 1989 WHICH WAS A

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:08.307
VERY DIVIDED CHINESE LEADERSHIP
IN WHICH ONE LEADER COULD TAKE

00:05:08.307 --> 00:05:12.812
THE FALL FOR THIS.
RIGHT NOW WE SAW XI JINPING

00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:16.516
CONSOLIDATE POWER IN THE 2022
CONGRESS.

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:18.751
I DON'T SEE ANY MAJOR
CHALLENGERS TO HIM RIGHT NOW.

00:05:18.751 --> 00:05:23.589
SO IT COULD BE POSSIBLE ONE OF
HIS DEPUTIES TAKE THE FALL BUT I

00:05:23.589 --> 00:05:25.792
DON'T SEE XI JINPING TAKING THE
FALL.

00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:31.230
&gt;&gt; HE'S ELIMINATED CHALLENGERS.
AND LET'S TALK ABOUT CHINA'S

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:35.435
ZERO COVID POLICY WHICH SPARKED
WHAT IS GOING ON RIGHT NOW.

00:05:35.435 --> 00:05:37.470
CL
CHINA TRIED TO RELAX THEM BUT

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:40.006
THEN FORCED TO TIGHTEN
RESTRICTIONS AGAIN BECAUSE CASES

00:05:40.006 --> 00:05:42.508
WENT UP.
THE FACT IS, IT IS COVID POLICY

00:05:42.508 --> 00:05:45.912
IS FAILING.
REALLY THEY DON'T HAVE THE

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:50.550
MEDICAL RESOURCES TO HANDLE IT
IF MORE AND MORE PEOPLE GET

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:55.254
SICK.
WHAT CAN XI JINPING AND THE

00:05:55.254 --> 00:05:58.357
CHINESE GOVERNMENT DO
REALISTICALLY TO TOOK THE COVID

00:05:58.357 --> 00:06:07.433
POLICY TO GIVE SOME GROUND TO
THESE PEOPLE OR CAN'T IT?

00:06:07.433 --> 00:06:10.269
&gt;&gt; SO CHINA IS NOW AT RECORD
NUMBER OF COVID CASES.

00:06:10.269 --> 00:06:14.807
A LITTLE BIT UNDER 40,000.
AND JUST TO PUT THIS IN CONTACT,

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:17.109
THAT IS AROUND THE SAME NUMBER
THAT THE UNITED STATES HAS.

00:06:17.109 --> 00:06:19.712
BUT THIS IS THE OFFICIAL CHINESE
REPORT.

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:21.647
WE DON'T KNOW IF THAT IS THE
ACTUAL NUMBER.

00:06:21.647 --> 00:06:24.617
IT COULD BE MUCH LARGER.
MAIN ISSUE AS YOU MENTIONED IS

00:06:24.617 --> 00:06:26.752
THE VACCINES.
RIGHT.

00:06:26.752 --> 00:06:30.223
WE KNOW THAT ABOUT 90% OF
CHINA'S POPULATION IS VACCINATED

00:06:30.223 --> 00:06:33.993
BUT ONLY 60% OF ITS ELDERS ARE
ACTUALLY BOOSTED.

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:37.163
AND WE ALSO KNOW THAT CHINA'S
VACCINES DON'T WORK QUITE AS

00:06:37.163 --> 00:06:42.335
WELL AS OUR MRNA VACCINES.
SO AS CHINA LOOKED FORWARD, THE

00:06:42.335 --> 00:06:45.438
MAIN ISSUE IS CAN IT AFFORD TO
OPEN UP AT THE RISK OF LARGE

00:06:45.438 --> 00:06:48.107
NUMBERS OF ITS POPULATION
POTENTIALLY CONTRACTING THE

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:52.645
VIRUS AND THEN DEPENDING ON
THEIR VACCINATION OR IF THEY'RE

00:06:52.645 --> 00:06:59.919
NOT VACCINATED, THEY COULD BE AT
RISK OF DYING OR SEVERE

00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:02.488
COMPLICATIONS.
&gt;&gt; AND CHINA HAS NOT IMPORTED

00:07:02.488 --> 00:07:05.491
THE BETTER MRNA VACCINES.
BONNIE LYNN, GREAT TO HAVE YOU

00:07:05.491 --> 00:07:07.326
ON.
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:07:07.326 --> 00:07:11.030
I WANT TO TALK MORE ABOUT THIS,
THESE LOCKDOWNS AND THE COVID

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:14.600
POLICY.
DR. AMESH ADALJA IS A SENIOR

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.970
SCHOLAR FROM THE JOHN HOPKINS
CENTER FOR HEALTH SECURITY,

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:22.041
JOINING ME LIVE.
DOCTOR, WE ARE SEEING CASES

00:07:22.041 --> 00:07:27.980
RISE, BUT THE REALITY THERE IS
THAT THESE LOCKDOWN MEASURES

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:32.117
HAVE LED TO IMMENSE HUMAN
SUFFERING ACROSS CHINA.

00:07:32.117 --> 00:07:37.957
AND AS I SAY, RISE, IRONICALLY
IN CASES WHERE PERHAPS, NOT

00:07:37.957 --> 00:07:42.028
IRONICALLY.
BUT WHAT IS YOUR VIEW ON THIS

00:07:42.028 --> 00:07:48.000
ZERO COVID STRATEGY?
AND DOES IT MAKE SENSE TO YOU?

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.003
&gt;&gt; ZERO COVID HAS NEVER MADE
SENSE TO ME.

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:54.106
WHEN YOU TRY TO IMPLEMENT IT,
IT IS A COMPLETE FAILURE.

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:57.944
THIS STEMS FROM THE FACT THAT
THIS IS A VIRUS THAT CANNOT BE

00:07:57.944 --> 00:08:01.247
ERADICATED, ELIMINATED.
IT TRANSMITS EFFICIENTLY, AND

00:08:01.247 --> 00:08:03.149
WAS ALWAYS DESTINED TO BECOME
AN ENDEMIC.

00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:05.952
YOUR GOAL WITH COVID-19 IS
ALWAYS BEEN TWO SEPARATE CASES

00:08:05.952 --> 00:08:09.088
FROM HOSPITALIZATIONS AND
DEATHS, TO REMOVE THE ABILITY

00:08:09.088 --> 00:08:13.993
OF THE VIRUS, TO CRUSH
HOSPITALS, NOT TO ERADICATE OR

00:08:13.993 --> 00:08:16.228
ELIMINATED, THAT IS A FANTASY.
UNFORTUNATELY, PEOPLE IN CHINA

00:08:16.228 --> 00:08:18.931
HAD TO SUFFER FOR SO LONG
BECAUSE OF THE CHINESE

00:08:18.931 --> 00:08:21.434
GOVERNMENTS APPEARING TO KIND
OF FANTASTICAL THINKING THAT IS

00:08:21.434 --> 00:08:28.140
NOT BASED IN REALITY.
&gt;&gt; FOR THOSE I MEAN, ZERO COVID

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:31.177
POLICY HAS MEANT VERY FEW
PEOPLE, THE NUMBERS ARE TICKING

00:08:31.177 --> 00:08:36.082
UP, HAVE ACTUALLY HAD COVID.
WHICH MEANS, I GUESS, CORRECT

00:08:36.082 --> 00:08:40.186
ME IF I AM WRONG, IT IS MUCH,
MUCH MORE LIKELY AS THEY COME

00:08:40.186 --> 00:08:45.958
OUT OF COVID, THAT CASES WILL
TAKE UP THERE IS NO IMMUNITY,

00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:47.960
CORRECT?
&gt;&gt; THERE'S NO IMMUNITY FROM

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.129
INFECTION BECAUSE SO MANY
PEOPLE HAVE NOT BEEN INFECTED.

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:53.966
THEY DO HAVE A FAIRLY HIGH
VACCINATION RATE IN THE GENERAL

00:08:53.966 --> 00:08:56.202
POPULATION.
BUT WE KNOW THOSE VACCINES ARE

00:08:56.202 --> 00:08:59.271
PROBABLY NOT AS EFFECTIVE AS
THE WESTERN VACCINES.

00:08:59.271 --> 00:09:03.943
SO THERE ARE A LOT OF PEOPLE
WHO HAVE THIS IMMUNITY GAP,

00:09:03.943 --> 00:09:07.079
WHICH WILL INCREASE CASES.
I THINK IT IS MORE IMPORTANT

00:09:07.079 --> 00:09:09.949
FOR CHINA TO FOCUS ON
PROTECTING THOSE AT RISK FOR

00:09:09.949 --> 00:09:12.318
HOSPITALIZATION BY PUTTING
EFFECTIVE VACCINES INTO THEM,

00:09:12.318 --> 00:09:15.320
GETTING DRUGS LIKE PAXLOVID
AVAILABLE, MAKING SURE THEY

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:18.124
HAVE THE CAPACITY, RATHER THAN
THIS UNSUSTAINABLE APPROACH

00:09:18.124 --> 00:09:20.192
THAT CAN NEVER AND BASED ON
WHAT THIS VIRUS IS.

00:09:20.192 --> 00:09:23.129
IF THEY STICK TO THIS, THERE IS
NO END IN SIGHT.

00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:26.132
IT WILL LEAD TO UNTOLD
SUFFERING, BOTH OF PEOPLES

00:09:26.132 --> 00:09:28.467
LIVES, AND ECONOMICALLY FOR
THEIR COUNTRY.

00:09:28.467 --> 00:09:33.973
&gt;&gt; SO IF THE LOCKDOWN WERE TO
BE DROPPED, WHAT WOULD THAT

00:09:33.973 --> 00:09:39.045
LOOK LIKE IN CHINA, GIVEN
CURRENT CASES AND VACCINE RATES,

00:09:39.045 --> 00:09:42.114
TO YOUR MIND?
&gt;&gt; WHAT WE WOULD SEE IS A SURGE

00:09:42.114 --> 00:09:44.183
IN CASES.
THAT IS NOT GOING TO BE

00:09:44.183 --> 00:09:47.019
ANYTHING SURPRISING.
THE VIRUS IS THERE, IT WILL

00:09:47.019 --> 00:09:48.954
SPREAD.
THE QUESTION IS HOW MANY

00:09:48.954 --> 00:09:50.423
HIGH-RISK PEOPLE WILL BE
INFECTED?

00:09:50.423 --> 00:09:53.059
WE KNOW THAT CHINA THINGS
BACKWARDS, THEY DID NOT MAKE

00:09:53.059 --> 00:09:55.194
THE VACCINE AVAILABLE TO PEOPLE
ABOVE 60 EARLY ON.

00:09:55.194 --> 00:09:58.497
WE KNOW THAT IS STILL TRICKLING
DOWN.

00:09:58.497 --> 00:10:01.300
THERE'S NOT THAT MANY HIGH RISK
PEOPLE WHO ARE VACCINATED.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:06.038
SO I DO THINK THAT WE WOULD SEE
A SURGE IN HOSPITALIZATIONS AND

00:10:06.038 --> 00:10:08.140
DEATHS AMONG THE HIGH-RISK,
WHETHER WE CAN HANDLE THAT

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:11.376
CAPACITY, THAT IS A QUESTION
THAT ONLY THEY COULD ANSWER

00:10:11.376 --> 00:10:13.512
BECAUSE THEY HAVE BEEN ABLE TO
BUILD HOSPITALS VERY QUICKLY.

00:10:13.512 --> 00:10:17.249
THE POINT IS, THEY ARE GOING TO
HAVE TO DO THIS AT SOME POINT.

00:10:17.249 --> 00:10:20.152
THEY HAVE HAD TWO AND A HALF
YEARS TO USE MRNA VACCINES IN

00:10:20.152 --> 00:10:23.055
THE POPULATION, BUT THEY HAVE
REFUSED THEM.

00:10:23.055 --> 00:10:27.059
SO TO ME IT IS NOT A SITUATION,
OF THEIR COMPLETE DOING.

00:10:27.059 --> 00:10:30.996
IT REALLY REFLECTS UTTER
INCOMPETENCE FROM THE CHINESE

00:10:30.996 --> 00:10:33.199
GOVERNMENT TO ALLOW THIS TO
FESTER ON, FOR TWO AND A HALF

00:10:33.199 --> 00:10:36.102
YEARS WITH THIS MATTER, WITH
THIS MAGICAL THINKING.

00:10:36.102 --> 00:10:39.839
&gt;&gt; FASCINATING, ISN'T IT?
THANK YOU, DR..

